    <briefdescription>
<para>Model-bound deployable product derived from a <ref refid="structthemis_1_1llm_1_1lora_1_1_lo_r_a_package" kindref="compound">LoRAPackage</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>An <ref refid="structthemis_1_1llm_1_1lora_1_1_adapter_product" kindref="compound">AdapterProduct</ref> is the deployable form of a LoRA adapter, bound to a specific base model. It records the compatibility commitment (expressed as a hash of the compatibility matrix) and links back to the originating <ref refid="structthemis_1_1llm_1_1lora_1_1_lo_r_a_package" kindref="compound">LoRAPackage</ref> via package_id.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>product_hash covers all content fields (excluding product_hash itself) and is computed by <ref refid="structthemis_1_1llm_1_1lora_1_1_adapter_product_1afac73d49bf463c20279de9ae5ca89b56" kindref="member">AdapterProduct::computeContentHash()</ref>. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
